@format 1
@id audio.save-plan
@title Save audio plan
@area Audio
@entry input
@summary Capture the current inspector plan after an audio-setting change and store it in the active source sidecar.
@flow TB
@related audio.restore-plan

@alias tab = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PAudioTab
@alias audio = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LAudio

[input] Audio setting changes <input>
- Receive a processing, parameter, active-state, or skip change @ tab.PAudioChangeHandle(...)
> guard

[guard] Check save target <decision>
- Confirm plan restoration is not in progress and an active source exists @ tab.PAudioPlanSave(...)
? "No writable active plan exists" > unchanged
? "Current plan can be saved" > persist

[persist] Persist plan <storage>
- Read the current ordered audio processing plan @ tab.PAudioProcessingRead(...)
- Store skip state and processing steps in the source sidecar @ audio.LAudioPlanSave(...)
> result

[result] Audio plan saved <output>
= The active source sidecar contains the current audio plan.

[unchanged] Save suppressed <output>
= No sidecar write occurs during restoration or without an active source.
